OL,3,GNEWSAReform leader accuses MSP of
OL,4,A'squatting' in seat after resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Reform UK in Scotland has
OL,7,Faccused an MSP of "squatting" in a
OL,8,FHolyrood seat won by the party.
OL,10,FMalcolm Offord said Amanda Bland did
OL,11,Fnot have a "personal mandate" to stay
OL,12,Fin the Scottish Parliament after she
OL,13,Fresigned from Reform to sit as an
OL,14,Findependent.
OL,16,FBland, who was elected as a list MSP
OL,17,Ffor Central Scotland and Lothians West
OL,18,Fin May's, denied claims she had stood
OL,19,Fdown after being called to a meeting
OL,20,Fabout high turnover among her office
OL,21,Fstaff.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
