OL,3,GNEWSAReform leader accuses MSP of
OL,4,A'squatting' in seat after resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfford said he was "disappointed" by
OL,7,Fher decision but Reform "wanted people
OL,8,Fwho could work as a team".
